# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code — allowlist, not denylist
#
# ~/.claude holds live OAuth tokens (.credentials.json), bot tokens
# (channels/*/.env), daemon keys, full prompt history and every session
# transcript. A denylist fails OPEN: anything a future Claude Code release adds
# is committed by default until someone notices. This repo is public, so the
# default has to be "ignored".
#
# Ignore everything under .claude/, then re-include exactly what claude_sync
# manages. Keep this list identical to CLAUDE_PATHS in
# .dotfile_scripts/claude_sync.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/hooks/

# App state file (OAuth tokens, MCP keys, conversation refs)
# NOTE: This lives at ~/.claude.json (outside .claude/ dir) —
# not relevant in the dotfiles repo but noted for awareness
# .claude.json

# Local project overrides
CLAUDE.local.md
